& [ClosedSupport] is exact
  + M2A strict topology values and receipt-root bindings are implemented and proven without I/O
  + direct windows-sys compile and ABI facts are pinned and proven without invoking the selected scanner functions
  + exact local-root platform preflight is implemented and physically proven only for its signed fixture scope
  + pure attribute, case, component, reserved-name, and order policy is implemented and proven
  + pure FILE_STREAM_INFO byte-region parsing is implemented and proven
  + five required supplied record classes now assemble atomically into one structurally coherent observation
  + the assembly projection intentionally omits path, Git mode, content digest, and ordinal
  + current global debug and overflow-checked release evidence is 293 passed with one governed physical ignore

& [SupportDelta] closes the prior composition gap only
  + [closed] epoch-local supplied fixed-query and stream records have one strict correlation and coherence target
  + [closed] the future physical adapter can submit one complete value aggregate instead of scattering cross-field policy across unsafe call sites
  + [closed] malformed, missing, inconsistent, negative, duplicate, or out-of-order supplied facts fail without partial release
  + [still_open] query success and buffer initialization provenance
  + [still_open] actual Windows origin, one-handle origin, one-object origin, and observation order
  + [still_open] pre-read versus post-read stability comparison
  + [still_open] content-read provenance and digest binding
  + [still_open] relative-path, Git-mode, and observation-ordinal assignment
  + [still_open] directory inventory repetition, whole-root traversal, Git reconciliation, receipt production, and admission integration
  + [still_open] remote and non-NTFS classification plus adversarial physical fixtures

& [CandidateComparison] is dependency ordered
  + [candidate_A] is jump directly to the private Windows producer
    - rejected now because temporal comparison semantics would then be designed inside an unsafe and physical slice
  + [candidate_B] is complete a TopologyEntryObservation from arbitrary supplied path, mode, digest, and ordinal
    - rejected now because it could fuse scanner-owned ordering and Git reconciliation with entry-local observation truth
  + [candidate_C] is pure pre-read and post-read supplied-entry stability reconciliation
    + closes one explicit RacePolicy dependency
    + consumes only already admitted pure assembly values plus closed caller-owned syntax identities
    + can compare exact entry-local facts without handles, paths, clocks, filesystem reads, or platform calls
    + leaves physical provenance, order, content read, traversal, and admission unresolved
  + [candidate_D] is learned or probabilistic drift scoring
    - rejected because the stability gate requires deterministic exact equality and typed difference evidence

& [SelectedBoundary] is pure supplied-entry stability reconciliation
  + [working_profile] is cantor-windows-supplied-entry-stability/0.1
  + [input] is one strict request containing a nonzero caller-owned reconciliation identity, one pre-read assembled observation, and one post-read assembled observation
  + [identity_rule] entry-reference identities must match while pre-read and post-read batch identities must be nonzero and distinct
  + [comparison] exact profile, kind, policy decision, diagnostic tag, strong identity, allocation size, end-of-file, link count, and raw stream record equality
  + [output] is one immutable stable pair retaining both observations and an exact comparison account, or one closed typed fault
  + [difference] identifies the first canonical differing field and preserves bounded before and after evidence
  + [release] occurs only when every required comparison is equal
  + [syntax_boundary] caller identities and pre/post labels are checked syntax, not proof of query order or common physical origin
  - never: accept a boolean stability claim
  - never: synthesize a missing observation, query result, default stream set, or provenance fact
  - never: construct a complete TopologyEntryObservation or issue a TopologyReceipt

& [DataBoundary] preserves distinct identities
  + [assembled_observation] is structurally admitted entry-local data
  + [observation_role] is caller-declared pre_read or post_read
  + [batch_identity] distinguishes the two supplied record batches syntactically
  + [entry_reference_identity] establishes only equality of a caller-owned reference token
  + [reconciliation_identity] binds one comparison request syntactically
  + [comparison_account] records the exact closed field set checked
  + [stable_pair] is a deterministic comparison result, not a physical or temporal fact

& [FailureBoundary] is fail closed
  + unknown profile, unknown serialized field, omitted observation, or malformed nested observation rejects
  + zero or reused batch identity rejects
  + unequal entry-reference identity rejects
  + any exact compared-field difference rejects with one stable canonical field code
  + unbounded diagnostic material truncates or rejects under a signed limit
  + malformed nested observations do not bypass the existing assembly validator
  + no partial stable pair accompanies a fault

& [RequirementDelta] is a new pure prerequisite set
  + [proposed_requirements] are M2B-ESR-001 through M2B-ESR-012
  + [authority_state] is unprocessed_source_not_yet_preserved
  + [implementation_state] is absent
  + [effect_state] is zero

& [NextAction] is source preservation before authority
  + preserve the selected boundary as a raw source document and manifest
  + process that source through the governing SJS protocol before canonical specification or code
  + require a distinct satisfaction signature and explicit prerequisite-signature bindings
  + keep all Win32, unsafe, filesystem, content-read, traversal, Git, receipt, admission, mutation, seal, test-execution, cleanup, and promotion authority absent

& [AuthorityEffect] is none
  + [canonical_authority] is absent
